WEBVTT

00:02.900 --> 00:04.730
The future...

00:05.010 --> 00:07.390
You're me from the future?

00:07.390 --> 00:08.760
That's right.

00:08.760 --> 00:13.240
I'm you, about 50 years from now.

00:15.580 --> 00:19.480
It was all so sudden.
There's no way I could believe that.

00:19.480 --> 00:23.510
I know your past name.

00:23.510 --> 00:26.890
Was that not enough for you
to believe me?

00:26.890 --> 00:29.720
There's magic in this world.

00:29.720 --> 00:32.009
It wouldn't be weird
if there were a mind reader.

00:32.009 --> 00:39.270
If there's magic that can read minds,
then time travel should be possible, no?

00:42.310 --> 00:48.590
Sorry, but I don't have time to explain
the details of time travel magic to you.

00:48.590 --> 00:53.740
It might sound like lines from
a Hollywood film, but really, no time left.

00:53.740 --> 00:54.830
Please listen to me.

00:54.830 --> 00:56.590
Hollywood movie...

00:56.950 --> 00:59.960
You are really me?

01:00.860 --> 01:01.960
But...

01:02.930 --> 01:05.710
There's nothing in the basement.

01:06.060 --> 01:09.900
I went down there
and thought there was nothing.

01:09.900 --> 01:11.590
In the following days...

01:11.590 --> 01:16.510
When the Man-God said there was nothing
to worry about since I didn't find anything,

01:16.510 --> 01:18.510
that put my mind at ease.

01:18.510 --> 01:20.980
But that was a mistake.

01:21.340 --> 01:22.700
A mistake?

01:22.700 --> 01:25.730
A few weeks after I went down
to the basement,

01:26.300 --> 01:28.480
Roxy died.

01:34.980 --> 01:37.120
Roxy died?!

01:37.120 --> 01:39.620
Why would going down to
the basement lead to that?

01:39.620 --> 01:42.330
Yeah, that won't make sense, right?

01:42.330 --> 01:45.210
Now, listen to my story calmly.

01:47.040 --> 01:50.920
I think there's a rat in the basement.

01:50.920 --> 01:53.540
A rat with a disease.

01:53.540 --> 01:57.660
When you open the basement door,
you'll startle the rat,

01:57.660 --> 02:00.090
and it'll run to the kitchen.

02:00.090 --> 02:03.940
There, it'll scavenge for
yesterday's leftover food.

02:04.510 --> 02:11.320
The next day, Aisha feeds those leftovers
to the stray cats, and they're all gone.

02:11.320 --> 02:13.270
But before that...

02:13.270 --> 02:18.330
Roxy, feeling a little hungry,
nibbles a bit on those leftovers.

02:18.830 --> 02:23.340
As a result, she catches the disease
the rat had been carrying.

02:23.340 --> 02:24.330
What disease?

02:24.750 --> 02:26.330
Petrification Syndrome.

02:27.710 --> 02:34.340
A disease that slowly turns the infected into
magic stone, and eventually leads to death.

02:34.340 --> 02:36.180
We didn't realize it at first.

02:36.180 --> 02:41.450
After all, it's rare for a human to be
infected with Petrification Syndrome.

02:41.450 --> 02:48.270
The pathogens can only infect
another life that dwells within the body.

02:48.270 --> 02:50.480
Another life?

02:51.730 --> 02:53.360
Wait, do you mean...

02:53.660 --> 02:55.110
The fetus.

02:57.140 --> 02:59.510
But Roxy isn't...

02:59.510 --> 03:01.620
She is pregnant.

03:01.620 --> 03:03.870
That's not surprising.

03:03.870 --> 03:06.810
The two of you did it a lot.
That's only natural.

03:07.630 --> 03:11.650
Petrification Syndrome
is carried by rats.

03:11.650 --> 03:15.880
You can spot one at a glance,
as their teeth turn into purple crystals.

03:16.320 --> 03:19.690
It can only be transmitted
through oral means.

03:19.690 --> 03:24.760
The pathogens grow inside the fetus,
turning the mother into a magic stone.

03:25.690 --> 03:29.520
Are you saying that Roxy will
be caught by this disease?

03:30.810 --> 03:34.980
If you just go down to the basement
without questioning anything,

03:34.980 --> 03:38.160
Roxy will come down with a fever
in a few days,

03:38.800 --> 03:41.410
and she will die.

03:44.760 --> 03:47.870
She didn't get better?
You did try to cure her, right?

03:48.990 --> 03:54.250
I went all the way to the Holy Country
of Millis to save her,

03:54.250 --> 03:59.390
and I managed to learn the incantation
for a god-tier detoxification magic.

03:59.740 --> 04:03.690
But when I finally got back,
it was too late.

04:03.690 --> 04:04.770
No way...

04:06.110 --> 04:11.130
It wasn't until 30 years later that
everything started to come together.

04:11.130 --> 04:13.440
It's all because of what
the Man-God says.

04:13.440 --> 04:16.190
Don't be misled by him.

04:16.620 --> 04:20.700
You have your previous life memories,
so you should understand.

04:21.329 --> 04:24.330
He's the root of all evil.

04:24.330 --> 04:25.830
The final boss.

04:30.420 --> 04:33.740
But why is he after Roxy?

04:33.740 --> 04:37.090
I still don't know about that.

04:37.090 --> 04:41.070
However, there's no doubt that
he's moving with some purpose in mind.

04:41.070 --> 04:44.850
The last thing he said to me was this:

04:44.850 --> 04:51.090
"Thanks to you being such an idiot,
everything went exactly as I planned."

04:51.090 --> 04:52.480
Damn it!

04:52.480 --> 04:54.870
The Man-God actually said that?

04:54.870 --> 05:02.610
As for what his goal is,
Orsted might know about that.

05:02.610 --> 05:05.750
I couldn't manage to meet him
in these 50 years.

05:06.510 --> 05:09.870
Even Nanahoshi didn't know
where he was?

05:13.490 --> 05:15.750
What happened to Nanahoshi?

05:16.620 --> 05:21.650
At the very last moment,
her experiment failed.

05:21.650 --> 05:27.300
She got depressed,
and I failed to cheer her up.

05:27.300 --> 05:28.800
And then...

05:30.010 --> 05:32.920
That's enough.
I don't want to hear it.

05:32.920 --> 05:35.400
I don't want to talk about it either.

05:37.650 --> 05:41.180
Listen, you'll learn about this later,

05:41.180 --> 05:44.230
but the "Man-God" was not
originally called by that name.

05:44.230 --> 05:45.660
What do you mean?

05:45.660 --> 05:50.560
It seems he was called
the "God of Men" in the past.

05:50.560 --> 05:53.540
But he refers to himself as
Man-God now.

05:53.890 --> 05:55.300
Why would he do that?

05:55.300 --> 05:59.420
Like I know. It's probably not
for a good reason anyway.

06:00.080 --> 06:06.390
On the surface, he only seemed
to say things that benefited me.

06:06.390 --> 06:10.600
It's true that he hasn't lied to you
up until this point.

06:11.100 --> 06:14.230
At least, not in a way I could tell.

06:14.230 --> 06:20.230
Everything was for this moment when you,
who are always doubting everything,

06:20.230 --> 06:25.360
to obey him without question!

06:26.370 --> 06:28.330
Don't be fooled by him!

06:28.330 --> 06:30.230
You've read manga, right?

06:30.230 --> 06:34.830
Those who talk about trust the most
are the ones who always tell lies!

06:34.830 --> 06:36.920
I know that, but...

06:36.920 --> 06:38.210
You know nothing!

06:38.550 --> 06:41.790
After you lose Roxy, next is...

06:41.790 --> 06:43.590
Next is Sylphie.

06:51.230 --> 06:54.450
Heartbroken over the loss of Roxy,

06:54.450 --> 06:57.940
you'll be unable to think about
Sylphie for a while.

06:57.940 --> 07:00.800
She will be hurt
and fall into depression.

07:00.800 --> 07:04.380
That's when Man-God manipulates Luke
to take advantage of this situation.

07:04.380 --> 07:05.820
He's going to Luke?

07:05.820 --> 07:08.500
Luke advised Ariel to go
to the Asura Kingdom,

07:08.500 --> 07:12.980
and Sylphie abandoned me
to go with them.

07:12.980 --> 07:17.210
They went there after Ariel failed
to gain Perugius's support.

07:17.790 --> 07:22.300
Ariel started a civil war,
only to be defeated.

07:22.300 --> 07:24.700
And Sylphie was killed in battle.

07:24.700 --> 07:27.470
Sylphie dies?

07:27.840 --> 07:31.600
You're going to lose both of them!

07:32.850 --> 07:37.440
I can still hear his voice when
he revealed the truth.

07:37.440 --> 07:41.160
I can still feel his hand on my shoulder
as he said, "Good job."

07:41.160 --> 07:44.020
I can still hear
his high-pitched laughter.

07:44.020 --> 07:45.660
Damn it...

07:45.660 --> 07:49.450
That damned bastard!

07:51.850 --> 07:55.530
I'll say this again.
Don't trust him.

07:55.530 --> 07:57.560
Or you will regret it.

08:02.030 --> 08:06.640
That said, I'm sure you don't
know what to do now.

08:06.640 --> 08:09.890
First of all, let's see...
It's about Eris.

08:10.210 --> 08:11.390
Eris?

08:11.390 --> 08:16.150
Write her a letter as soon as possible.

08:16.150 --> 08:20.580
Tell her you may have cheated on
her a bit, but you still love her.

08:20.580 --> 08:24.500
No, I don't! It's her fault
I became impotent back then!

08:24.500 --> 08:26.380
Just forgive her.

08:26.380 --> 08:29.490
That's what makes a real man, isn't it?

08:29.490 --> 08:36.169
Well, I couldn't forgive her,
and I ended up at odds with her for years.

08:36.169 --> 08:37.289
What?

08:37.289 --> 08:42.090
She nearly killed me countless times.

08:42.090 --> 08:48.880
She'd chase me everywhere, and each time
we met, it turned into an all-out fight.

08:48.880 --> 08:53.020
But I guess she was holding back.

08:53.020 --> 08:58.650
If she really wanted to, there were
plenty of ways she could've killed me.

08:58.650 --> 09:02.060
On the contrary,
whenever I was in danger,

09:02.060 --> 09:05.180
she'd come to save me
from the shadows.

09:05.180 --> 09:09.950
Almost like that prince
of the vegetable kingdom.

09:11.450 --> 09:15.590
She's always loved me.

09:15.590 --> 09:19.740
But she's terrible with words and
doesn't know how to express herself.

09:19.740 --> 09:22.710
So all she can do is talk with her fists.

09:22.710 --> 09:26.990
I may have loved Eris at one point,

09:26.990 --> 09:29.300
but I already have Sylphie and Roxy.

09:29.300 --> 09:31.150
No problem.

09:31.150 --> 09:36.220
They'll allow it if you explain
things beforehand.

09:36.220 --> 09:41.230
Besides, you still love her, don't you?

09:44.300 --> 09:45.980
Even so...

09:45.980 --> 09:49.750
You can surround yourself with
all the women who love you.

09:49.750 --> 09:51.170
That sounds wonderful, doesn't it?

09:51.170 --> 09:54.450
Don't go saying things
as if it has nothing to do with you.

09:55.560 --> 09:59.470
I have no one left.

09:59.470 --> 10:02.460
I'm telling you this because you are me.

10:04.290 --> 10:09.980
She's been doing her best to be with me.

10:09.980 --> 10:14.890
If you couldn't accept her,
what's the point of all her efforts?

10:14.890 --> 10:18.810
That was how Ghislaine condemned me,

10:19.160 --> 10:21.770
as I stand in front of Eris's corpse.

10:24.160 --> 10:26.850
So Eris dies too?

10:26.850 --> 10:31.670
Yeah, she dies after protecting me.

10:32.960 --> 10:38.860
Listen, you have to send that letter,
unless you want to regret it, just like me.

10:38.860 --> 10:42.970
O-Okay, if you put it that way,
I'll send it.

10:42.970 --> 10:45.080
But where am I supposed to send it?

10:45.080 --> 10:49.460
The Sword Sanctum.
You've probably had a hunch, right?

10:50.540 --> 10:53.490
Don't write anything that
might push her away.

10:53.490 --> 10:58.070
If she falls into despair,
you'll be killed.

10:58.070 --> 10:59.350
I understand.

11:00.910 --> 11:03.800
I failed to understand her.

11:03.800 --> 11:08.860
I thought I understood what
kind of person Eris was.

11:08.860 --> 11:12.800
She never intended to abandon me.

11:12.800 --> 11:16.120
But I didn't realize that.

11:16.120 --> 11:20.740
And that's how we drifted apart
and found ourselves in misery.

11:24.300 --> 11:28.920
I forgot to mention this.
Don't treat the Man-God as your enemy!

11:29.350 --> 11:32.280
Not treating him as an enemy?
But you said he's deceiving me?

11:32.280 --> 11:35.800
Yes, but you won't be able
to win against him.

11:36.200 --> 11:40.800
I could never reach him.

11:42.060 --> 11:45.880
When I realized that, I was shaken.

11:46.460 --> 11:51.400
I can never avenge Roxy and Sylphie.

11:53.120 --> 11:58.860
I've trained hard to take him down,
but in the end I couldn't even reach him.

11:58.860 --> 12:02.620
He just won't come within my reach.

12:02.620 --> 12:05.160
I can make things levitate.

12:05.160 --> 12:08.400
I can send messages from a distance.

12:08.400 --> 12:09.820
More than that,

12:09.820 --> 12:14.420
I can leap through time
and return to the past.

12:14.420 --> 12:18.130
Well, this magic was a failure, though.

12:18.130 --> 12:19.340
A failure?

12:20.260 --> 12:23.880
The magic in this world is omnipotent.

12:23.880 --> 12:27.750
Once you understand that,
you can do anything you want.

12:27.750 --> 12:31.150
You can even regrow a lost arm.

12:31.150 --> 12:35.970
But none of this power has any meaning.

12:35.970 --> 12:38.390
By the time I got strong enough,

12:38.390 --> 12:42.790
the people I wanted to protect
were all gone.

12:44.450 --> 12:45.620
Hey!

12:46.100 --> 12:47.660
Is something wrong?

12:50.740 --> 12:53.860
I'll tell you one more time.

12:53.860 --> 12:55.820
You can't win against the Man-God.

12:55.820 --> 12:57.910
There's no way to beat him.

12:57.910 --> 13:01.250
Even if you have to suck up to him,

13:01.250 --> 13:03.510
don't make an enemy of him!

13:03.510 --> 13:07.690
You'll just end up getting
taken advantage of...

13:08.700 --> 13:12.380
There are three things you have to do.

13:12.380 --> 13:14.820
Consult Nanahoshi.

13:14.820 --> 13:17.330
Write Eris a letter.

13:17.330 --> 13:21.450
Doubt the Man-God without
opposing him.

13:21.900 --> 13:24.420
That's too sudden...

13:24.420 --> 13:27.350
Can't you give me any more
detailed advice?

13:27.350 --> 13:29.200
Advice, huh?

13:30.330 --> 13:32.330
This brings back memories.

13:32.330 --> 13:36.710
Come to think of it,
I was really slacking off back then.

13:37.090 --> 13:42.880
Well, I would like to give you more
details and tell you as much as I can.

13:42.880 --> 13:44.600
But my time is up.

13:44.600 --> 13:48.530
You keep saying that you don't have
enough time, what's with that?

13:48.530 --> 13:50.980
Are you in a hurry to watch
a midnight anime?

13:51.320 --> 13:54.580
No, it's over...

13:55.230 --> 13:59.460
And, don't rely too much on others.

13:59.460 --> 14:06.030
When you first came to this world,
you didn't rely on anyone.

14:06.030 --> 14:12.170
Also, with me coming here,
your future has already changed.

14:12.170 --> 14:16.990
Since I returned to the past like this,

14:16.990 --> 14:20.890
my history won't change.

14:24.760 --> 14:30.270
You will probably lead
a different life than I did.

14:30.980 --> 14:34.270
Just as you have up until now,
you'll achieve success,

14:34.270 --> 14:36.270
and you'll meet failures.

14:36.270 --> 14:38.770
You'll reflect on your mistakes,

14:39.110 --> 14:40.890
and you'll regret them too.

14:43.460 --> 14:45.720
Hey, are you okay?!

14:48.580 --> 14:52.520
Don't think just because
I came from the future,

14:52.520 --> 14:57.590
there's a way to make up
for mistakes.

14:57.590 --> 15:03.470
There's no such thing as being
able to redo your life.

15:04.500 --> 15:08.290
I've written all my experiences
in this diary.

15:08.290 --> 15:13.730
Do your best to make sure
you don't have regrets.

15:14.320 --> 15:22.230
Don't let that bastard laugh at you,
like he did to me.

15:22.560 --> 15:24.860
What's wrong with your body?

15:26.270 --> 15:33.360
I wasn't able to bring
my entire body to the past.

15:33.360 --> 15:35.930
But you said you could even
regrow your arm?

15:35.930 --> 15:39.250
I don't have any mana left.

15:39.650 --> 15:42.890
If only Cliff were still alive...

15:42.890 --> 15:45.630
Traveling to the past would
go more smoothly...

15:45.970 --> 15:49.340
I still have to tell you more
about this...

15:51.490 --> 15:54.980
Sorry. You've done enough.
You don't have to say any more.

15:56.480 --> 16:00.410
I don't want you to have regrets.

16:00.410 --> 16:04.480
Don't let the Man-God do whatever
he wants to you.

16:04.810 --> 16:10.400
Why at a time like this...
So much I still need to say...

16:10.400 --> 16:12.990
I came all the way to the past...

16:13.660 --> 16:16.870
At least, let me see them...

16:19.870 --> 16:24.420
Oh! Sylphie... Roxy...

16:24.950 --> 16:27.270
Damn it...

16:27.270 --> 16:32.630
They are adorable as always...

16:50.480 --> 16:54.380
Rudy, I heard voices and some noise.

16:54.380 --> 16:55.640
Is someone here?

16:55.640 --> 16:57.160
Is it a thief?

16:57.160 --> 16:59.620
Sorry, I was half-asleep, you see.

16:59.920 --> 17:02.880
I had a weird dream
and used some magic.

17:02.880 --> 17:06.670
You used magic in your sleep?
Are you okay?

17:06.670 --> 17:09.010
If you're having a hard time,
should we sleep together?

17:12.540 --> 17:14.300
No, it's fine.

17:14.730 --> 17:15.890
Rudy?

17:16.180 --> 17:18.300
I'm really okay.

17:18.300 --> 17:19.890
You two can go back to your room.

17:20.430 --> 17:23.069
I'll go to sleep
after I tidy up the room.

17:25.490 --> 17:28.400
If you have worries,
don't hesitate to tell us.

17:28.400 --> 17:30.070
Thank you.

17:30.070 --> 17:33.280
Then, I have one favor to ask.

17:33.280 --> 17:36.620
I want both of you not to leave
your room tonight.

17:36.990 --> 17:40.710
Not leaving the room?
Uh... But why?

17:40.710 --> 17:42.500
About that...

17:43.840 --> 17:47.560
I understand.
If you say so, I'll do it.

17:49.340 --> 17:50.940
Yeah, right.

17:50.940 --> 17:53.140
Okay, as you say.

17:56.850 --> 17:59.150
Well then, good night.

17:59.150 --> 18:00.430
Good night, Rudy.

18:00.430 --> 18:02.410
Good night.

18:11.290 --> 18:13.220
It all happened so suddenly.

18:13.220 --> 18:17.020
It's still hard to believe,
but there is one thing I can say.

18:17.020 --> 18:19.490
I don't want to lose those two.

18:20.510 --> 18:25.420
And I don't want to die with regrets,
as that old man did.

19:30.680 --> 19:34.850
I will bury these skeletons
in the same place as Paul.

19:34.850 --> 19:39.410
If he really was me,
that would make him happy.

19:49.100 --> 19:52.550
The old man had told me
not to go, but...

19:59.070 --> 20:02.890
I think there's a rat in the basement.

20:15.830 --> 20:17.070
Frost Nova.

20:19.760 --> 20:20.950
Frost Nova.

20:52.150 --> 20:57.150
Maybe I should send it to
the Mages' Guild for them to research.

20:57.580 --> 21:02.110
If I report what I heard from the old man
about Petrification Syndrome,

21:02.110 --> 21:04.950
they could check
if his claims are correct or not.

21:05.310 --> 21:07.950
What should I do first?

21:08.340 --> 21:11.170
What can I do right now?

21:13.380 --> 21:17.920
If I read this, perhaps I can learn
about future events.

21:18.410 --> 21:20.940
But he also said that my future
has already changed.

21:20.940 --> 21:25.260
To put it in gaming terms,
this is an alternate timeline.

21:25.260 --> 21:28.430
A world that has changed because
my future self returned to the past.

21:28.430 --> 21:31.020
Even if I read this diary
and prepared for it,

21:31.020 --> 21:34.250
there's a good chance things won't
turn out exactly as described here.

21:36.320 --> 21:40.070
There are three things you have to do.

21:40.070 --> 21:42.550
Consult Nanahoshi.

21:42.550 --> 21:45.080
Write Eris a letter.

21:45.080 --> 21:49.140
Doubt the Man-God without
opposing him.

21:52.330 --> 21:56.830
I can't just ignore this diary
and proceed ahead.

21:57.460 --> 22:01.920
Because this diary is
that old man's trail.

22:01.920 --> 22:04.930
EPISODE 12
AN END AND A BEGINNING

23:34.930 --> 23:39.940
NEXT EPISODE
DIARY
